{"Early wrapping is already enabled by your current settings. If this error persists after a full restart, send OptiScaler*.log and OptiScaler.ini for diagnosis.", "当前设置已允许提前接管。如果完全退出并重启游戏后仍然报错，请提供 OptiScaler*.log 和 OptiScaler.ini 排查。"},
{"Try Compatibility & Scheduling > Early command-list wrap = force on, then Save Settings and restart the game.", "可尝试在“兼容性与调度”中将“提前接管”设为“强制开启”，然后保存设置并重启游戏。"},
{"If already tried after restarting, send OptiScaler*.log and OptiScaler.ini for diagnosis. Allow enhanced barriers does not fix a missing proxy.\nEarly wrapping can cause startup problems. If that happens, restore the previous LmxxfEarlyExeWrap value in OptiScaler.ini before launching again.", "如果已开启并重启后仍然报错，请提供 OptiScaler*.log 和 OptiScaler.ini 排查。“允许增强屏障”无法解决未接管的问题。\n提前接管可能导致启动异常。如遇此情况，请先在 OptiScaler.ini 中将 LmxxfEarlyExeWrap 恢复为修改前的值，再启动游戏。"},
{"Enhanced-barrier input was rejected. Try Allow enhanced barriers = force on, then Save Settings. This permission applies immediately; early wrapping is a separate setting.", "增强屏障输入被拒绝。可尝试将“允许增强屏障”设为“强制开启”并保存设置，此许可立即生效；它与“提前接管”是独立选项。"},
