{"Experimental. Inline execution restores known whole-resource layouts; partial or pending layouts are rejected.\nInline still needs this on: the input layout is read (and reset to COMMON) even\nwhen the network runs inline, so turning it off rejects list input that uses\nenhanced barriers. See \"NR inline\" for details.\nAuto: on for Forza (exe name contains \"forza\"), off otherwise. Applies immediately.\nINI: LmxxfAllowEnhancedBarriers.", "实验选项。内联执行会恢复已知的完整资源布局；局部或未完成的布局转换会被拒绝。\n内联模式仍需要开启此项：即使网络内联运行，也会读取输入布局并重置为 COMMON，关闭后使用增强屏障的列表会被拒绝。\n自动：Forza（EXE 名含 forza）开启，其他游戏关闭。立即生效。\nINI：LmxxfAllowEnhancedBarriers。"},
