{"NR -> SR uses unjittered motion. Mochizuki SR -> NR passes the game vectors through, including jittered ones, and the runtime scales render-resolution motion. The separate Residual Stabilizer filters the final correction.", "NR -> SR 使用不含抖动的运动矢量。Mochizuki 的 SR -> NR 传入游戏矢量，包括带抖动的矢量，并由运行时缩放渲染分辨率运动。独立的残差稳定器平滑最终修正。"},
