{"Maximum amount of sharpness that motion can add or remove.\n\nNegative values reduce sharpening in motion (recommended).\nPositive values increase sharpening in motion.\n\nThe final adjustment scales with motion and is capped at this value.", "运动可增加或减少的最大锐化量。推荐负值以降低运动中的锐化；正值增强。实际调整随运动变化，并受此值限制。"},
{"Meant for development purpose to test if\nwriting a larger value to reactive mask, reduces ghosting.", "开发调试项：增大响应遮罩值，观察是否减少拖影。"},
