{"Per-pass overrides apply to the DX12 multipass path, including NR after RR. Native Vulkan and the driver-proxy backend remain single-pass.", "逐层覆盖适用于 DX12 多层路径，包括 RR 后 NR。原生 Vulkan 和驱动代理后端仍为单层。"},
{"Performance", "性能"},
{"Please select %s as upscaler from game\noptions and load a save game to enable Opti settings.\nUpscalers don't always work in menus.", "请在游戏选项中选择 %s 超分并载入存档，之后即可调整 OptiScaler。游戏菜单里不一定会运行超分。"},
