{"Positioning", "位置"},
{"Positive values decrease sharpness at high contrast areas.\nNegative values increase sharpness at high contrast areas.", "正值降低高对比区域的锐化，负值增强该区域锐化。"},
{"Prebuild capacity", "层数预留"},
{"Prebuild passes", "预留层数"},
{"Automatic prebuild capacity grows as needed and is retained on pass reduction. Capacity is not the active pass count.", "自动按需预留更多层的资源；减少执行层数后，仍保留已准备的资源。预留层数不代表实际执行层数。"},
{"Model scale (WorkingScale) is 25-100% of this stage. Edits apply when editing finishes. 50% halves width and height.", "模型比例（WorkingScale）是该阶段的 25–100%。调整结束后应用。50% 表示宽和高各减半。"},
{"The slider covers passes 1-3 and applies when editing finishes. Allow 30 layers adds Layer mode. 30 layers hides the slider, costs about 30 model runs and can rebuild.", "滑块是 1–3 层，调整结束后应用。允许 30 层后会出现切层模式。30 层会隐藏滑块，大约是 30 次模型计算，并可能重建网络。"},
{"Allow 30 layers", "允许 30 层"},
{"Allow up to 30 layers", "允许最多 30 层"},
{"Appearance and tonemap", "外观和色调"},
{"Lighting (experimental)", "光照（实验）"},
{"Advanced preset hints (effect unverified)", "高级预设提示（效果尚未验证）"},
{"The pass control applies when editing finishes. Allow up to 30 layers raises it from 1-3 to 1-30. The selected count can rebuild; 30 runs the model thirty times.", "层数在调整结束后应用。允许最多 30 层会把范围从 1–3 提高到 1–30。所选层数可能重建网络；选 30 会让模型运行 30 次。"},
{"Automatic prebuild capacity grows as needed and is retained on pass reduction. Capacity is not the active pass count. 0 is automatic. An explicit count is at least the active passes.", "自动按需预留更多层的资源；减少执行层数后，仍保留已准备的资源。预留层数不代表实际执行层数。0 为自动。手动设置不会低于当前层数。"},
{"Layer mode", "切层模式"},
{"Slider (1-3)", "滑块（1–3）"},
{"30 layers", "30 层"},
{"30 layers. The pass slider is off in this mode.", "30 层。此模式不使用层数滑块。"},
{"30-layer mode builds capacity for all 30 layers. The 1-3 prebuild slider is hidden.", "30 层模式会为全部 30 层准备容量。1–3 的预留滑块已隐藏。"},
{"Default off. Off keeps the 1-3 pass slider.\nOn shows Layer mode. 30 layers runs the model thirty times with one history each, then composes once.\nThat mode hides the slider. It rebuilds the network. The VRAM budget can refuse it.\nINI: [DlssNr] MochizukiUnlockPasses.", "默认关闭。关闭时保留 1–3 层滑块。\n开启后显示切层模式。30 层会把模型跑 30 次，每层各有一份历史，最后合成一次。\n该模式隐藏滑块，并重建网络。显存预算可能拒绝。\nINI：[DlssNr] MochizukiUnlockPasses。"},
{"Slider (1-3) uses the pass slider.\n30 layers ignores the slider. Counts from 4 to 29 are not a mode.\nPasses 2 and 3 can still override. Later layers inherit pass 1 with local tone 0.\nINI: [DlssNr] MochizukiLayerMode.", "滑块（1–3）使用层数滑块。\n30 层不使用滑块。4 到 29 不是一种模式。\n第 2、3 层仍可单独覆盖。其后各层继承第 1 层，局部色调为 0。\nINI：[DlssNr] MochizukiLayerMode。"},
{"DRS buckets reduce rebuilds when the render size changes. White point controls linear-input brightness.", "尺寸分档可减少动态分辨率变化引起的网络重建。参考白用于调整线性输入的亮度。"},
