{"Completed-sample means from the same window. Standard NR cost measures the core network kernel loop, including fused temporal shaders. RenoDX network callbacks sum every record_engine callback, including its core preparation and composition, not just network kernels. Other processing is the total minus that route's measured network scope. Equivalent throughput is 1000 / GPU ms, not game Present FPS. Excludes the D3D12 bridge, host post-processing and whole-frame latency. A zero-network RenoDX stage is a valid sample.", "显示同一窗口内已完成样本的平均耗时。标准路径 NR 开销统计核心网络内核循环，包括融合的时序着色器。RenoDX 网络回调累计所有 record_engine 回调，包含回调内的核心准备和合成，而非仅网络内核。其他处理为总计减去该路径所测的网络范围。等效处理帧率为 1000 / GPU 毫秒数，并非游戏 Present 帧率。不含 D3D12 桥接、主程序后处理及整帧延迟。RenoDX 阶段未执行网络时，零网络耗时仍是有效样本。"},
