{"RenoDX callbacks include core preparation/history/composition, not just kernels. Completed-sample means; equivalent throughput, not game Present FPS. Excludes D3D12 bridge / host post-processing.", "RenoDX 回调包含核心准备、历史处理和合成，而非仅网络内核。已完成样本平均耗时；等效处理帧率并非游戏 Present 帧率。不含 D3D12 桥接及主程序后处理。"},
{"Standard network includes the kernel loop and fused temporal shaders. Completed-sample means; equivalent throughput, not game Present FPS. Excludes D3D12 bridge / host post-processing.", "标准路径网络范围包含内核循环和融合的时序着色器。已完成样本平均耗时；等效处理帧率并非游戏 Present 帧率。不含 D3D12 桥接及主程序后处理。"},

