{"Allows pacing spinlock to sleep, should reduce CPU usage\nMight cause slow ramp up of FPS", "允许 pacing 自旋锁休眠，应能降低 CPU 占用\n可能导致帧率爬升变慢"},
{"Ignores all prechecks for XeFG\nDon't use this option to skip MV size warning for UE games!\nIt might cause crashes and bad IQ!", "忽略 XeFG 的所有预检查\n不要用此选项跳过 UE 游戏的运动矢量尺寸警告！\n可能导致崩溃与画质劣化！"},
{"Disable HUD/UI interpolation\nReverts back to previous XeFG 2 behaviour\n\nFixes artifacting transparent HUD/UI", "禁用 HUD/UI 插帧\n回退到之前的 XeFG 2 行为\n\n修复透明 HUD/UI 的伪影"},
{"Override XeFG only after DLSS NR successfully runs.\nNever changes the base multiplier or enables frame generation.\nNR off/failure/session rebuild restores the current base multiplier.\nSkipped frames and pauses keep the override. Save Settings to persist.\nChanging multipliers briefly pauses/rearms frame generation.", "仅在 DLSS NR 成功运行后才覆盖 XeFG。\n从不改变基础倍率，也不启用帧生成。\nNR 关闭/失败/会话重建时恢复当前基础倍率。\n跳帧与暂停期间保持覆盖。保存设置以持久化。\n更改倍率会短暂暂停并重新准备帧生成。"},
{"Picks the multiplier every frame, up to the highest the provider reports\n(XeFG MaxInterpolatedFrames, 8X after the unlock), not the Frame Gen setting.\nIt takes the lowest multiplier that reaches the target. It can go above the target,\nonly the FPS limit or V-Sync caps the presented frame rate.\nWhen the target can't be reached, a higher multiplier is kept\nonly if it raises the frame rate enough: each generated frame\ncosts GPU time.\nThe Frame Gen and NR multipliers only apply while Dynamic MFG is off.", "每帧选择倍率，上限为 provider 报告的最大值\n（XeFG MaxInterpolatedFrames，解锁后为 8X），而不是“帧生成”设置。\n取能达到目标的最低倍率。它可以高于目标，\n只有 FPS 限制或垂直同步会限制实际呈现帧率。\n当目标无法达到时，只有确实能提升帧率才保留更高倍率：\n每个生成帧都要付出 GPU 时间。\n“帧生成”与 NR 倍率仅在动态多帧生成关闭时生效。"},
{"Where the number that divides the frame comes from.\n\nPaper white only -- the slider below and nothing else. Right for a\ngame whose exposure never moves, wrong the moment it does: one\nconstant cannot serve a cave and a field.\n\nThe game's own exposure -- read from the texture the game hands\nthe upscaler. The best source there is, because it is decided\nupstream and nothing this pass does can move it. Not every game\nsupplies one.\n\nA buffer the scan found -- for games that compute an exposure and\nnever pass it on. A GUESS: candidates are matched by shape, and in\nGTA V the best one tracks the real exposure but at its own scale,\nwhich the anchor's ratio cancels. Needs anchoring once, and checking\nafterwards.", "除以画面的那个数字从哪来。\n\n仅纸白——只用下方滑块，别无其他。适合曝光从不变化的游戏，\n一旦变化就不对：一个常数无法同时服务洞穴与旷野。\n\n游戏自身曝光——从游戏交给超分器的纹理读取。最好的来源，\n因为它由上游决定，本处理做什么都无法移动它。但不是每个游戏都提供。\n\n扫描找到的缓冲——适用于计算了曝光却从不传递的游戏。这是猜测：\n候选按形状匹配，在 GTA V 中最佳候选能跟踪真实曝光但处于自己的刻度，\n需由锚点比率抵消。需要锚定一次并在之后检查。"},
{"The white point for the selected calibration point, or -- with no row\nselected -- the value the next Anchor press captures.\n\nSet it until the picture looks right here, then Anchor. Move to very\ndifferent light and do it again: two points fix the buffer's real\nrelationship and the white point holds between them. Click a row below\nto come back and adjust that point; click it again to let go.", "所选校准点的白点；若未选中任何行，则是下一次点击“锚定”时捕获的值。\n\n把它调到当前画面看起来正确，然后点“锚定”。换到差异很大的光照下再做一次：\n两个点就能确定缓冲的真实关系，白点在两点之间都成立。\n点击下方某一行可回来调整该点；再次点击则取消选中。"},
{"A multiplier on the scan's white point, and the control you adjust between\nanchor points: dial it until the picture looks right in the current\nlight, then press Anchor here -- it captures the trimmed value as a new\npoint and resets the trim to 1.", "扫描白点的倍率，也是锚点之间调整用的控件：\n把它调到当前光照下画面看起来正确，然后点此处的“锚定”——\n它会把微调后的值捕获为新锚点，并把微调重置为 1。"},
{"A multiplier on the exposure the game supplied. 1.00x takes its number\nexactly, and that is the right answer here.\n\nThis is not a fudge factor. If a game needs the trim far from 1 to look\nright, that is evidence the exposure being read is wrong for that game,\nnot that the game wants trimming. Somewhere around 0.8 to 1.25 is honest\ntuning; reaching for 4 means something upstream is broken and the trim is\nhiding it.\n\nYour manual paper white is kept separately and comes back untouched if\nyou switch the option above off.", "对游戏提供的曝光的倍率。1.00x 精确采用它的数值，\n在此处这就是正确答案。\n\n它不是补偿系数。如果某个游戏需要把微调拉到远离 1 才正常，\n那说明读取到的曝光对该游戏而言是错的，而不是游戏需要微调。\n0.8 到 1.25 左右属于合理调校；拉到 4 意味着上游有问题，\n而微调只是在掩盖它。\n\n手动纸白单独保存，关闭上方选项后会原样恢复。"},
{"The most the pass may move any pixel, as a multiple of what it already was, in\nboth directions -- a pixel may not be brightened past this nor darkened past\nits reciprocal. Lights are where the model has least to say and rescaling its\nanswer does the most damage; 2x leaves detail intact while stopping a strip\nlight turning into a string of coloured cells. Raise it only if bright areas\nlook clipped.", "该层允许像素改变的最大倍数（相对原值），双向限制——\n像素不得亮于此值、也不得暗于其倒数。光源处模型最没发言权，\n而缩放其答案造成的破坏最大；2x 既保留细节，\n又能阻止灯带变成一串彩色格子。仅在亮部显得被裁切时才提高。"},
{"A lamp in the corner: red for dark, green for full light, and the\nshades between, with the reading beside it.\n\nIt is how you see at a glance that the scan is TRACKING rather\nthan merely running. Walk into shade and it should slide toward\nred; step out and it should go green. If it moves the wrong way,\nthat is what the setting above is for.\n\nPurely a readout. It changes nothing.", "角上的指示灯：暗为红、全亮为绿，中间为过渡色，旁边显示读数。\n\n它让你一眼看出扫描是在跟踪，而不只是运行。\n走进阴影应向红滑动；走出应转绿。若方向相反，\n就是上方那个设置的用途。\n\n纯读取，不改变任何东西。"},
{"On: New wait mode (0.3.1 1-pixel draw). Still being tested.\nOff: Original wait mode (switches immediately).\nRestart if prompted: hooks or a pass may not be ready for new wait mode.\nFrames that cannot use new wait mode still fall back to original wait.", "开启：新等待模式（0.3.1 的 1 像素绘制）。仍在测试。\n关闭：原始等待模式（立即切换）。\n若提示重启请重启：钩子或某层可能尚未准备好新等待模式。\n无法使用新等待模式的帧仍会回退到原始等待。"},
{"On (default): game waits for NR in the same frame (historical path).\nOff: async (daniel Async=1); pre-upscale is forced off because it requires inline.\nSaved to dlssnr_on_amd.ini only with Save Settings. Restart may be required.", "开启（默认）：游戏在同一帧等待 NR（历史路径）。\n关闭：异步（daniel Async=1）；超分前会被强制关闭，因为它需要 inline。\n仅在保存设置时写入 dlssnr_on_amd.ini。可能需要重启。"},
{"QueuePriority=1: high-priority HIP stream (helps under heavy load).\nOff: null stream (QueuePriority=0).\nSaved to dlssnr_on_amd.ini only with Save Settings.", "QueuePriority=1：高优先级 HIP 流（重负载时有帮助）。\n关闭：空流（QueuePriority=0）。\n仅在保存设置时写入 dlssnr_on_amd.ini。"},
{"On (default): larger Color is fitted onto the 1080 network.\nThat can cost same-frame time and memory.\nOff: a wide frame is admitted only when width is\nat most 2560, height at most 1080, and the pixel count stays\nwithin 1920x1080. 2024x848 passes. 2560x1080 does not.\nApplies on the next frame, including after a resolution change.\nThe network may rebuild once. No restart.", "开启（默认）：更大的 Color 会被适配到 1080 网络。\n这会增加同帧的时间与内存开销。\n关闭：仅当宽度不超过 2560、高度不超过 1080，且像素数\n不超过 1920x1080 时才接受宽帧。2024x848 通过，2560x1080 不通过。\n下一帧生效，分辨率变化后同样生效。\n网络可能重建一次。无需重启。"},
{"Upstream default since 0.40: none (all blocks). This base list applies to every real network pass.\nOptional: enter 42,43,46 to skip the three blocks used by the pre-0.40 default. Enter none to run all blocks again.\nThe field below adds skips only in passes 2/3. Skipping changes quality and style.\nPress Enter to apply; rebuilds next frame. INI: DLSS5_SKIP_BLOCKS.\nDisable MH byte stream before skipping blocks 5-22 or 48-65. Blocks 4/69 are unsupported.", "0.40 起上游默认：none（全部块）。此基础列表作用于每个真实网络层。\n可选：输入 42,43,46 可跳过 0.40 之前默认使用的三块。输入 none 恢复全部块。\n下方字段仅在 2/3 层追加跳过。跳过会改变质量与风格。\n按回车应用；下一帧重建。INI: DLSS5_SKIP_BLOCKS。\n跳过 5-22 或 48-65 块前请关闭 MH byte stream。块 4/69 不受支持。"},
{"Default none. Added to the base skip list only for real network passes 2/3; pass 1 is unchanged.\nThis changes the style and usually saves little time. Not a cheaper equivalent of full multi-pass.\nBlocks 4/69 and byte-stream C64/C128/C256 blocks are unsupported; invalid combinations fall back to no extra skipping.\nPress Enter to apply; rebuilds next frame. Ignored with one pass. A predicted third pass has no extra network blocks.\nINI: DLSS5_MULTI_PASS_SKIP_BLOCKS.", "默认 none。仅对真实网络第 2/3 层追加到基础跳过列表；第 1 层不变。\n这会改变风格，通常只省一点时间。它不是完整多层的廉价替代。\n块 4/69 与 byte-stream C64/C128/C256 块不受支持；无效组合会回退为不额外跳过。\n按回车应用；下一帧重建。单层时忽略。预测的第三层没有额外网络块。\nINI: DLSS5_MULTI_PASS_SKIP_BLOCKS。"},
{"900/1080 tiers with wave-owned attention and pooled allocations. Applies on network rebuild.\nUses bounded GPU recovery if the queue times out; incompatible layouts use normal launches.", "900/1080 层级使用 wave 自有 attention 与池化分配。网络重建时生效。\n队列超时时使用有界 GPU 恢复；不兼容的布局使用常规启动。"},
{"Default off. Writes NrFrameDiag.log next to the DLL (split and inline) for PresentMon join.", "默认关闭。在 DLL 旁写入 NrFrameDiag.log（分离与 inline），用于 PresentMon 关联。"},
{"Requires measurement and file logging. At most one summary every five seconds.", "需要测量与文件日志。最多每五秒一次摘要。"},
{"Freezes the frame the model works on. While held, change paper white, the\nstrengths, the reversible mode, the model preset -- anything below the\nupscaler -- and only that setting moves; the scene does not.\n\nWhat it CANNOT show: DLSS/FSR/XeSS upscaler presets or anything upstream\n(the upscaler is not re-run on a held frame), and the game's own HUD and\npost-processing, which run after this pass and keep updating. The white\npoint stops being measured and holds its value while frozen, so it cannot\ndrift and confound the comparison.\n\nHide the menu and it stays held. Untoggle to resume.", "冻结模型所处理的帧。冻结期间，修改纸白、各强度、可逆模式、模型预设——\n任何超分之后的设置——只有该项会变，场景不动。\n\n它无法展示：DLSS/FSR/XeSS 超分预设或任何上游设置\n（冻结帧不会重跑超分），以及游戏自身的 HUD 与后处理，\n它们在本次处理后运行并持续更新。白点会停止测量并在冻结期间保持，\n因此不会漂移、干扰对比。\n\n隐藏菜单后仍保持冻结。取消勾选恢复。"},
{"Shows the pass against itself, so the two can be seen at once rather than\ntoggled and remembered.\n\nSide by side puts the whole frame in each half, untouched on the left and\nedited on the right. Both halves are squeezed horizontally to fit, so it is\nfor looking at rather than playing in.\n\nWipe cuts a single frame at the split and resamples nothing, so the picture\nis the right shape and can be played normally. Drag the split below; it is a\nstored setting and stays put once the menu is closed.\n\nNeither needs the menu open to keep working. A hairline marks the join.", "让该层与自身对比，一次看到两种结果，而不用来回切换凭记忆比较。\n\n并排：每半显示整帧，左侧未编辑、右侧已编辑。两半会被横向压缩以适配，\n因此适合观察，不适合游玩。\n\n撕开：在分割处裁切单帧，不做重采样，因此画面比例正确、可以正常游玩。\n在下方拖动分割线；这是持久设置，关闭菜单后仍保留。\n\n两者都不需要打开菜单才生效。接缝处有一条细线标记。"},
{"Writes which side is which onto the frame itself, so a screenshot still\nsays so after it has left this machine. Drawn into the picture's own\nplane: in the wipe the split reveals and hides the label exactly as it\ndoes the images, and there is nothing to drag. Swap sides moves the\nlabels with their pictures.", "把哪一侧是哪一侧直接画到帧上，截图离开本机后仍能分辨。\n它绘制在画面自身平面上：在撕开模式下，分割线对标签的揭示/隐藏\n与对画面完全一致，且没有可拖拽的东西。交换两侧会连同标签一起移动。"},
{"Puts the edited frame on the other side.\n\nWorth doing once you have decided which you prefer: the eye is not\neven-handed about left and right, and a difference can read as an\nimprovement purely from where it sits. If the same side still wins after\nswapping, it is the pass you are seeing and not the placement.", "把编辑后的帧放到另一侧。\n\n在你确定偏好后值得做一次：眼睛对左右并不公平，\n差异可能仅仅因为位置就被读成“更好”。如果交换后仍然是同一侧胜出，\n那说明你看到的是该层的效果，而不是位置造成的错觉。"},
{"How much of the frame each half shows.\n\nA half is half as wide as the frame and just as tall, so the frame\ncannot fill it and keep its shape.\n\nAt 1 the whole frame is there at its right proportions, with bars above\nand below. At 2 the half is filled and the sides are cropped away\ninstead. Anything between trades one for the other.", "每半显示画面的多少。\n\n半宽与整帧相同高度，因此整帧无法既填满又保持比例。\n\n1：整帧按正确比例显示，上下留黑边。\n2：半格被填满，改为裁掉两侧。介于两者之间则在这两种之间取舍。"},
{"What the model is shown, and how its answer comes back.\n\nOff (soft knee): the default. It rolls highlights off so hard the model\ncannot resolve detail in them -- fine in soft-lit scenes, weak in bright ones.\n\nNeutwo composed: an unclipped curve so the model sees highlight detail, then\neverything above (Detail/Colour strength, highlight guard, palette). It wins in\nbright scenes, but the curve compresses MIDTONES too, so in soft-lit content it\ncan be worse than Off. It also shifts paper white -- re-check it when you switch.\n\nHybrid composed: the best of both, and the one to use. Identity in the\nmidtones -- as good as Off there -- and the unclipped roll only in the\nhighlights, so it recovers the detail Off crushes without giving up the\nmidtones Neutwo does. It barely shifts paper white.\n\nReplace: the raw model straight back through the exact inverse, none of the\ncomposition -- no guard, no palette, no strengths. Gorgeous where there are no\nbright lights, but they FLASH in motion. A reference, not a daily setting.\n\nHybrid replace: the raw model like Replace, but on the hybrid curve -- the\ndecode is identity in the midtones, so the flashing is confined to genuine\nbright highlights instead of everywhere. Most of Replace's detail, far more\nstable. If you love the Replace look but the flicker bothers you, use this.\n\nOff is byte-identical to before.", "模型看到的画面，以及答案如何回来。\n\n关闭（软膝）：默认。它把高光压得很狠，模型在其中无法分辨细节——\n柔和光照场景尚可，明亮场景偏弱。\n\nNeutwo 合成：不裁切的曲线，模型能看到高光细节，然后经过\n上方所有处理（细节/颜色强度、高光护栏、调色板）。明亮场景更强，\n但曲线也会压缩中间调，因此在柔和光照内容中可能不如关闭。\n它还会移动纸白——切换时请重新检查。\n\n混合合成：两者之长，推荐使用。中间调保持恒等——与关闭一样好——\n只在高光使用不裁切滚降，从而恢复关闭时压掉、又不必牺牲 Neutwo\n所牺牲的中间调。几乎不移动纸白。\n\n替换：原始模型经精确逆变换直接返回，不做合成——无护栏、无调色板、\n无强度。没有强光时非常漂亮，但运动中会闪烁。参考用，不适合日常。\n\n混合替换：像替换一样用原始模型，但走混合曲线——\n中间调解码为恒等，因此闪烁只出现在真正的亮部，而不是到处都有。\n保留替换模式的大部分细节，稳定性高得多。如果你喜欢替换的观感\n但受不了闪烁，用这个。\n\n关闭与之前逐字节一致。"},
{"-1 follows local structure; 0 reduces skin structure independently.\nThis is not a skin-colour/tone off switch. Use the final skin/scene controls below for that.", "-1 跟随局部结构；0 独立降低皮肤结构。\n这不是肤色/色调的开关。请使用下方的最终皮肤/场景控件。"},
{"NVIDIA's internal automatic mask, not the colour-based preview below.\nWith Skin structure=-1 it follows general structure, so the difference may be subtle.\nTry Skin structure=0 versus Local structure=1 to compare. Mask accuracy is model-dependent.", "NVIDIA 内部的自动掩码，而非下方的颜色预览。\n当皮肤结构 = -1 时它跟随一般结构，差异可能很细微。\n可对比“皮肤结构=0”与“局部结构=1”。掩码精度取决于模型。"},
{"Off preserves colour in selected pixels; lighting/detail can still change.\nAlso set Skin detail / lighting to 0 to suppress both.", "关闭会在选中像素中保留颜色；光照/细节仍可能变化。\n若要同时抑制两者，请把“皮肤细节/光照”也设为 0。"},
{"Off is the normal picture.\nProxy is what the network is shown. Model output is its raw answer.\nDifference amplifies the edit.\nApplies on the next frame. No restart.", "关闭为正常画面。\nProxy 是网络实际看到的画面；Model output 是它的原始答案。\nDifference 会放大编辑差异。\n下一帧生效，无需重启。"},
{"Resets this backend and shared NR controls. Keeps backend selection, hot-switch preference, keybinds and the other backend settings.", "重置此后端与共享 NR 控件。保留后端选择、热切换偏好、快捷键以及其他后端设置。"},
{"Synthesises detail in the upscaler's frame, before frame generation sees it.\n\nNeeds two similarly named files beside OptiScaler, one character apart:\n  nvngx_dlssnr.dll       NVIDIA's model (~165 MB) -- you supply it\n  nvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll   the forwarder (~13 KB) -- ships in this package\nUndocumented and driven directly, so none of this is officially supported.", "在超分帧中合成细节，发生在帧生成读取它之前。\n\n需要 OptiScaler 旁两个名字只差一个字符的文件：\n  nvngx_dlssnr.dll       NVIDIA 的模型（约 165 MB）——需你自备\n  nvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll   转发器（约 13 KB）——随本包提供\n未公开且直接驱动，因此不受官方支持。"},
{"Runs Neural Rendering on the render-resolution colour input immediately before\nSuper Resolution, so SR temporally accumulates and upscales the enhanced frame.\n\nRay Reconstruction is deliberately excluded: its input contract differs and\nuses the separate Apply after Ray Reconstruction option. Origin-zero padded\ninputs use their active render size; offset or invalid inputs fall back post-SR.\n\nThis placement control currently applies to the Direct3D 12 path and its\nDirect3D 11/Vulkan bridges; native Vulkan keeps the post-upscale path.", "在超分辨率之前，直接对渲染分辨率的颜色输入运行神经渲染，\n使 SR 能在时域上累积并超分增强后的帧。\n\n光线重建被刻意排除：其输入契约不同，\n请使用单独的“光线重建后应用”选项。原点零填充的输入\n使用其活动渲染尺寸；偏移或无效输入会回退到 SR 之后。\n\n此位置控制目前适用于 Direct3D 12 路径及其\nDirect3D 11/Vulkan 桥接；原生 Vulkan 仍走超分之后。"},
{"Requires the game's native Ray Reconstruction option. RR denoises and upscales\nfirst; NR then processes its output before frame generation.\nThis does not add RR to games without the required rendering buffers.\nIndependent controls below prevent inheriting the cost of the SR configuration.\nNative Vulkan does not use these DX12 controls.", "需要游戏自带的光线重建选项。RR 先降噪并超分，\n随后 NR 处理其输出，再交给帧生成。\n这不会为缺少所需渲染缓冲的游戏添加 RR。\n下方独立控件可避免继承 SR 配置的开销。\n原生 Vulkan 不使用这些 DX12 控件。"},
{"Relative to RR's OUTPUT resolution: 0.50x at 4K runs NR at 1920x1080.\nRR itself remains full quality. The NR edit is resized for final composition.\nPasses 2 and 3 use the same per-pass model profiles as the SR path.", "相对于 RR 的输出分辨率：4K 下 0.50x 意味着 NR 以 1920x1080 运行。\nRR 本身保持完整质量。NR 编辑结果会缩放后参与最终合成。\n第 2、3 层使用与 SR 路径相同的逐层模型配置。"},
{"Whether the model's edit is applied. Off shows the clean upscaler frame while the\npass keeps running -- so with Hold frame (under Compare) you can freeze a\nframe and toggle this to see the same frozen frame with and without Neural\nRendering. Leave it on for normal use.", "是否应用模型的编辑。关闭时显示干净的超分帧，\n但层仍在运行——因此在“对比”下的“冻结帧”中，你可以冻结画面并切换此项，\n查看同一帧有无神经渲染的差异。正常使用时请保持开启。"},
{"Runs sequential model layers between one encode and one final composition.\nEach additional layer consumes the previous layer's model output and owns\na separate persistent feature and temporal history.\n\nThe base proxy stays immutable and the final answer is composed against it\nonce, so colour and transfer strength do not compound. Local tone is applied\nonly by the first layer.\n\nCost scales almost linearly. Two is the common 'deep fried' look; three is\nthe guarded ceiling because later layers converge while cost and artifacts grow.", "在一次编码与一次最终合成之间运行顺序模型层。\n每增加一层都会消费上一层的模型输出，并拥有\n独立的持久特征与时域历史。\n\n基础代理保持不变，最终结果只与它合成一次，\n因此颜色与传输强度不会叠加。局部色调仅由第 1 层应用。\n\n开销近似线性增长。两层是常见的“重口味”观感；三层是受保护的上限，\n因为后续层收益递减，而开销与伪影增加。"},
{"The filter that averages the model's above-native answer back to display size --\nthis is what turns supersampling into LESS noise rather than more. Sharper\nfilters (Lanczos3, Kaiser3) keep the most detail; softer ones (Bicubic,\nCatmull-Rom) are gentler on ringing. Independent of the Output Scaling\ndownscaler, so the two can differ and run at the same time.", "把模型高于原生的答案平均回显示尺寸的滤波器——\n正是它让超采样变成“更少噪声”而不是更多。更锐利的\n滤波器（Lanczos3、Kaiser3）保留最多细节；较软的（Bicubic、\nCatmull-Rom）对振铃更温和。它与“输出缩放”的降采样器独立，\n因此两者可以不同并同时运行。"},
{"What fraction of the frame the model works at. Cost falls with the square of\nthis, so half resolution is roughly a quarter of the time.\n\nThe frame is never reduced. Only the model's contribution is computed small\nand enlarged, so the picture underneath is untouched whatever this says.\n\nWhat it trades: the shading the model adds is broad and survives enlargement;\nthe fine structure it synthesises does not, and softens. Worth having when the\npass costs more than you want to pay for the detail it returns.\n\nThe frame itself stays at full detail whatever this says -- only the\nmodel's own work is done small.", "模型工作在画面的多大比例上。开销随其平方下降，\n因此半分辨率约为四分之一耗时。\n\n帧本身从不缩小。只有模型的贡献以小尺寸计算\n再放大，因此无论此项如何，底层画面都不变。\n\n代价是：模型添加的明暗是大范围的，放大后仍在；\n它合成的精细结构则不会，会被柔化。当该层开销\n超过你愿意为这些细节付出的代价时，值得开启。\n\n无论此项如何，帧本身保持完整细节——只有\n模型自身的工作以小尺寸完成。"},
{"How the model's work is brought back up when it ran below the frame's size.\n\nClassic composes the model's small picture directly against the full-size\nframe. Those two disagree by the shrink's blur as well as by the model's edit,\nand the composition cannot tell them apart -- it reads the blur as brightness\nthe frame has and the model never saw. The lower the model resolution the\nlarger that error, and it is the colour shift that shows up at 50%.\n\nMatched residual carries up only the model's difference and lays it on the\nframe's own proxy, so both pictures being compared are full size and the only\nthing that came from the small raster is the edit itself.\n\nNo effect at 100% or above: there is no residual to carry and the two are\nidentical (supersampling brings its answer down to frame size before this).\n\nFrom hhkbble's multi-pass work on this fork.", "模型工作在低于帧尺寸时，结果如何还原。\n\nClassic 直接把模型的小图与全尺寸帧合成。两者之间\n既差着缩小的模糊，也差着模型的编辑，而合成无法区分——\n它把模糊当成帧本身具有、模型从未见过的亮度。模型分辨率\n越低，这个误差越大，50% 时表现为偏色。\n\nMatched residual 只上提模型的差值，并叠加到帧自身的代理上，\n因此被比较的两张图都是全尺寸，唯一来自小栅格的就是编辑本身。\n\n100% 及以上无效果：没有残差可提，两者完全相同\n（超采样在此之前已把答案降到帧尺寸）。\n\n源自 hhkbble 在本分支的多层工作。"},
{"How far the frame moves toward the model's picture.\n\nThe model's answer is not added to the frame -- it is a complete picture of its\nown, rescaled so its luminance sits where the original says it should. This\nblends between the two, so both ends are real pictures and everything between\nthem is one too.\n\n0 gives back exactly what the upscaler produced. 1 is the model's picture.\nThe lmxxf codec accepts 0 to 3. Above 1 extrapolates past the network result.\n\nThis is the control to push if you want more effect: Intensity belongs to the model\nand it decides what to do with it.", "画面向模型图靠近的程度。\n\n模型的答案不是叠加到帧上——它是一张完整的图，\n经重缩放使其亮度落在原始帧指示的位置。此项在两者之间混合，\n因此两端都是真实画面，中间也是。\n\n0 精确返回超分器的产物；1 是模型的图。\nlmxxf 编解码接受 0 到 3；大于 1 会外推到网络结果之外。\n\n想要更强效果就推这个：Intensity 属于模型，\n由它决定如何使用。"},
{"Whether the model's colour arrives with its light.\n\n0 keeps the game's own hue exactly -- every pixel is the original colour with\nonly its brightness carrying the model's verdict. Game-accurate colour, with\nthe detail. 1 brings the model's colour as well, in its own hue, clamped into\nAP1 so nothing unreachable is asked for.\n\nThis cannot shift hue on its own: it interpolates between two finished\npictures rather than adding a colour difference to one, which is what used to\nlet a warm subject come back green.\n\nAbove 1 it OVER-SATURATES: the colour keeps its hue but grows more vivid,\nand rolls off at the edge of what the display can show rather than clipping\ninto a flat blown patch. 1 is the model's own colour; push past it for punch.\nThe lmxxf codec accepts 0 to 3.", "模型的颜色是否随其光照一起到来。\n\n0 精确保留游戏色相——每个像素都是原色，\n只有亮度承载模型的判断。颜色忠于游戏，细节保留。\n1 同时带入模型颜色（其自身色相），并钳制到 AP1，\n避免要求显示不出的颜色。\n\n它本身不能改变色相：它在两张成品图之间插值，\n而不是给某张图加色差——后者正是以前暖色主体变绿的原因。\n\n大于 1 会过饱和：颜色保持色相但更鲜艳，\n并在显示能力边缘滚降，而不是裁成死白。\n1 是模型自身颜色；想要冲击力可继续推。lmxxf 编解码接受 0 到 3。"},
{"Blends the final NR correction for all backends. 0 = original, 1 = full effect, above 1 amplifies it.\nThis does not reduce model computation. Disable NR to save that work.\nA pure-backend session may require a restart to enable the shared effect recording path.", "混合所有后端的最终 NR 校正。0 = 原始，1 = 完整效果，大于 1 会放大。\n这不会减少模型计算量；要节省开销请禁用 NR。\n纯后端会话可能需要重启才能启用共享效果录制路径。"},
{"Reduces temporal variation in the NR correction using motion and depth.\nMay soften moving detail; disabled by default. Requires valid motion and depth inputs.", "利用运动与深度减少 NR 校正的时域变化。\n可能使运动细节变软；默认关闭。需要有效的运动与深度输入。"},
{"Limits history changes in the compressed colour domain (units of 1/255). Higher values can reduce flicker but increase trailing.", "在压缩颜色域（1/255 单位）限制历史变化。数值越高越能减少闪烁，但会加重拖影。"},
{"Resets Overall Intensity, residual gains and protections, Person protection, and Residual Stabilizer.", "重置总体强度、残差增益与保护、人物保护，以及残差稳定器。"},
{"Wrap command lists created before the swapchain. Shared by lmxxf and Mochizuki.\nAuto: EXE calls in Unreal/Forza, ACMirage.exe and 007FirstLight.exe; UnityPlayer.dll calls in Aniimo only.\nForce on: EXE calls and UnityPlayer.dll calls in other Unity games too.\nForce off: disable both early paths; normal post-swapchain wrapping stays enabled.\nOther games are unvalidated; forcing early wrap can cause startup problems.\nSave and restart to apply. INI: LmxxfEarlyExeWrap.", "包装交换链创建之前的命令列表。lmxxf 与 Mochizuki 共享。\n自动：Unreal/Forza、ACMirage.exe 和 007FirstLight.exe 走 EXE 调用；仅 Aniimo 走 UnityPlayer.dll 调用。\n强制开启：其他 Unity 游戏的 EXE 与 UnityPlayer.dll 调用也包装。\n强制关闭：禁用两条提前路径；交换链之后的正常包装仍启用。\n其他游戏未经验证；强制提前包装可能导致启动问题。\n保存并重启生效。INI: LmxxfEarlyExeWrap。"},
{"Also wrap command lists created by any module (Streamline, dxgi proxies, overlays).\nOnly effective before the swapchain is created. Auto: on for Forza only.\nMay crash other games; try only if the log shows many 'missing recording proxy'.\nSave and restart to apply. INI: LmxxfEarlyAnyModuleWrap.", "同时包装任意模块（Streamline、dxgi 代理、覆盖层）创建的命令列表。\n仅在交换链创建之前有效。自动：仅 Forza 开启。\n可能导致其他游戏崩溃；仅当日志出现大量“missing recording proxy”时才尝试。\n保存并重启生效。INI: LmxxfEarlyAnyModuleWrap。"},
{"Leave off unless a game needs NR on lists that use\nenhanced barriers (may corrupt state / TDR).\nInline does not replace this: NR still reads and resets the\ninput layout on an inline list, so an enhanced-barrier game\nneeds this on with Inline as well.\nAuto: on for Forza (exe name contains \"forza\"), off otherwise. Applies immediately.\nINI: LmxxfAllowEnhancedBarriers.", "除非游戏需要在使用增强屏障的列表上运行 NR，否则请保持关闭（可能破坏状态 / TDR）。\nInline 不能替代它：NR 仍会读取并重置 inline 列表的输入布局，因此使用增强屏障的游戏即使开了 Inline 也需要此项。\n自动：Forza（exe 名含“forza”）开启，其他关闭。立即生效。\nINI: LmxxfAllowEnhancedBarriers。"},
{"Mochizuki backend only. Where its linear/HDR white point comes from. Default Off.\nOff: manual White point only.\nFollow game: use the game's exposure; manual when the game gives none.\nOwn meter: ignore the game and measure the frame itself (one tiny GPU pass, one frame late).\nAuto: the game's exposure when usable, else the own meter, else manual.\nTry Own meter or Auto when skin turns red at overall intensity above 1 (e.g. Monster Hunter Wilds).\nINI: MochizukiWhitePointSource (0-3).", "仅 Mochizuki 后端。其线性/HDR 白点来源。默认关闭。\n关闭：仅使用手动白点。\n跟随游戏：使用游戏曝光；游戏未提供时用手动。\n自测光表：忽略游戏，直接测量画面（一个极小的 GPU pass，延迟一帧）。\n自动：游戏曝光可用时用它，否则用自测光表，再否则用手动。\n若总体强度大于 1 时皮肤发红（如《怪物猎人：荒野》），可试自测光表或自动。\nINI: MochizukiWhitePointSource (0-3)。"},
{"With white point source off, this is the white point. With any auto source, it is a brightness trim on top of the automatic result; 1.0 = no change. Mochizuki backend only.", "白点来源关闭时，这就是白点值。使用自动来源时，它是在自动结果之上的亮度微调；1.0 = 不变。仅 Mochizuki 后端。"},
{"Default off. Off keeps the pass control at 1-3.\nOn raises that control to 1-30. It does not jump to 30.\nThe count applies when editing finishes. Each added layer runs the model again and can rebuild.\n30 is the heavy end of the range. Passes 2 and 3 can still override. Later layers inherit pass 1 with local tone 0.\nINI: [DlssNr] MochizukiUnlockPasses and MochizukiPasses.", "默认关闭。关闭时层数控制保持 1-3。\n开启后该控制扩展到 1-30，但不会直接跳到 30。\n层数在编辑结束时生效。每增加一层都会重新运行模型并可能重建。\n30 是范围的重负载端。第 2、3 层仍可覆盖。后续层继承第 1 层，局部色调为 0。\nINI: [DlssNr] MochizukiUnlockPasses 与 MochizukiPasses。"},
{"Default off. Writes NrFrameDiag.log next to the DLL (split and inline) for PresentMon join. No sync GPU waits.", "默认关闭。在 DLL 旁写入 NrFrameDiag.log（分离与 inline），用于 PresentMon 关联。不做同步 GPU 等待。"},
{"Default off. Needs per-frame NR diag. Timestamps only: game thread Present -> first submit and\nfence waits (gw_* fields in NrFrameDiag.log). No behavior change. INI: NrGameWaitDiag.", "默认关闭。需要逐帧 NR 诊断。仅记录时间戳：游戏线程 Present -> 首次提交以及\nfence 等待（NrFrameDiag.log 中的 gw_* 字段）。不改变行为。INI: NrGameWaitDiag。"},
{"Resets this page's mochizuki controls, including hidden later-pass overrides on the model page. Keeps shared effects and other backends.", "重置本页的 mochizuki 控件，包括模型页中隐藏的后续层覆盖。保留共享效果与其他后端。"},
{"Resets mochizuki and shared NR controls. Keeps other backends, selection and hotkeys.", "重置 mochizuki 与共享 NR 控件。保留其他后端、选择与快捷键。"},
{"Hot switching requires NrConvenience and command-list hooks armed at startup.\nWith hot switching off, only the selected backend loads.\nClosed GPU recordings retain their resources until Reset/Release and completion.", "热切换要求 NrConvenience 与命令列表钩子在启动时已就绪。\n关闭热切换时，只加载选定的后端。\n已关闭的 GPU 录制会保留资源，直到重置/释放并完成。"},
{"NR -> SR enhances the render-resolution input. SR -> NR enhances the upscaled output.\nMochizuki SR -> NR keeps the game's render-resolution motion and the runtime scales it.\nDaniel and lmxxf SR -> NR resample depth and motion onto the output grid.\nThe model resolution setting is relative to the selected input; SR -> NR can cost much more GPU time and memory.\nSwitching clears history. If recording hooks were not enabled at startup, Save Settings and restart.\nNative Ray Reconstruction and native Vulkan are not added by this option.\nMochizuki passes jittered motion through. Daniel and lmxxf use spatial NR for those vectors.\nUnsupported buffers keep the SR image and show a status message.\nINI: [DlssNr] RunBeforeSR=true / false. Save Settings to keep the selection.", "NR -> SR 增强渲染分辨率输入；SR -> NR 增强超分后的输出。\nMochizuki 的 SR -> NR 保留游戏的渲染分辨率运动，由运行时缩放。\nDaniel 与 lmxxf 的 SR -> NR 会把深度与运动重采样到输出网格。\n模型分辨率设置相对于所选输入；SR -> NR 会显著增加 GPU 时间与内存。\n切换会清空历史。若录制钩子未在启动时启用，请保存设置并重启。\n此选项不会添加原生光线重建或原生 Vulkan。\nMochizuki 直通抖动运动；Daniel 与 lmxxf 对这些矢量使用空间 NR。\n不支持的缓冲会保留 SR 图像并显示状态消息。\nINI: [DlssNr] RunBeforeSR=true / false。保存设置以保留选择。"},
{"Small uses a different trained model and one network pass. Original retains your 1-3 pass preference.\nEach entry is enabled only when its weights are present in native-game-tiled-assets.\nINI: LmxxfNetworkModel (0 Original, 1 Small). Changing models rebuilds the network next frame.", "Small 使用另一套训练模型且只跑一层网络；Original 保留你的 1-3 层偏好。\n每项仅在其权重存在于 native-game-tiled-assets 时才启用。\nINI: LmxxfNetworkModel（0 Original，1 Small）。切换模型会在下一帧重建网络。"},
{"Keeps the game command list intact. Bounded wait selects the original frame on timeout.\nShared by lmxxf and Mochizuki. INI: NrInline. Off uses command-list splitting.\nInline does NOT remove the recording proxy or the enhanced-barrier requirement,\nand it does not fix a game that hands us unwrapped command lists (NR would still\nalternate with the original frame). It only skips the split-ineligible rejection.", "保持游戏命令列表完整。有界等待在超时时选择原始帧。\nlmxxf 与 Mochizuki 共享。INI: NrInline。关闭时使用命令列表拆分。\nInline 不会移除录制代理或增强屏障要求，\n也不能修复交给未包装命令列表的游戏（NR 仍会与原始帧交替）。\n它只是跳过“不满足拆分条件”的拒绝。"},
{"Default on. R11G11B10_FLOAT, RGBA8/BGRA8 (UNORM and sRGB) and RGB10A2 colour\nframes convert input and write-back on the compute queue instead of graphics blits,\nso the inline chain is not split across queues.\nModel scale below 100% also needs compute model downscale; rescaled motion vectors split it unless compute motion rescale is on.\nRebuilds the network for those formats. INI: NrInlineComputeConvert.", "默认开启。R11G11B10_FLOAT、RGBA8/BGRA8（UNORM 与 sRGB）和 RGB10A2 颜色帧在计算队列上完成输入转换与回写，而不是图形 blit，\n这样 inline 链不会被跨队列拆分。\n模型缩放低于 100% 时还需要计算队列模型降采样；若未开启计算队列运动重缩放，缩放后的运动矢量会拆链。\n对这些格式会重建网络。INI: NrInlineComputeConvert。"},
{"Default on. With dynamic resolution, motion vectors of another size are\nrescaled by a compute pass (bilinear, like the blit) instead of a graphics blit,\nso the inline chain is not split by them. With 2+ layers, every layer also samples the motion\nvectors in place (no motion blit). Remakes the frame buffers (and the network with 2+ layers).\nINI: NrInlineComputeMotion.", "默认开启。动态分辨率下，尺寸不同的运动矢量由计算 pass 重缩放（双线性，与 blit 相同），而不是图形 blit，\n因此 inline 链不会被它们拆分。2 层及以上时，每层还就地采样运动矢量（无运动 blit）。\n会重建帧缓冲（2 层及以上还会重建网络）。INI: NrInlineComputeMotion。"},
{"Default on. Model scale below 100%: the frame is filtered down by a compute pass\n(the same taps as the blit) and the answer written back on compute, so the inline chain\nis not split by the downscale. Rebuilds the network when scaled.\nINI: NrInlineComputeDownscale.", "默认开启。模型缩放低于 100% 时，帧由计算 pass 降采样（与 blit 相同的采样点），结果在计算队列回写，\n因此 inline 链不会被降采样拆分。缩放时会重建网络。\nINI: NrInlineComputeDownscale。"},
{"Default on. Multi-layer NR exports its first layer by a compute pack\ninto the frame format instead of a blit, so the inline chain is not split by it.\nRGBA16F, R11G11B10, RGBA8/BGRA8 UNORM and RGB10A2. Rebuilds the network when exporting.\nINI: NrInlineComputeExport.", "默认开启。多层 NR 用计算 pack 把第 1 层导出为帧格式，而不是 blit，\n因此 inline 链不会被它拆分。支持 RGBA16F、R11G11B10、RGBA8/BGRA8 UNORM 与 RGB10A2。\n导出时会重建网络。INI: NrInlineComputeExport。"},
{"Default off. Inline (GPU-armed): size the post-claim GPU wait from a measured iterations/ms rate (target ~4 ms); halve after a cap or abort, grow back after 64 clean waits. Off = fixed cap.\nINI: NrAdaptiveWaitBudget.", "默认关闭。Inline（GPU 触发）：根据实测的 iterations/ms 速率设定认领后 GPU 等待的时长（目标约 4 ms）；触顶或中止后减半，连续 64 次干净等待后逐步恢复。关闭 = 固定上限。\nINI: NrAdaptiveWaitBudget。"},
{"CPU handoff only (GPU-armed handoff off). How often the inline worker re-checks that the game captured NR inputs.\nFixed 100 us finds ready inputs sooner at a small CPU/poll cost. Applies to the next frame.\nEvent: side queue watches the capture flag and a fence event wakes the worker.\nINI: NrCaptureBackoff (0 exponential, 1 fixed 100 us, 2 event).", "仅 CPU 交接（GPU 触发关闭）时有效。inline 工作线程重新检查游戏是否已捕获 NR 输入的频率。\n固定 100 微秒能更快发现就绪输入，代价是少量 CPU/轮询开销。下一帧生效。\n事件模式：侧队列监视捕获标志，由 fence 事件唤醒工作线程。\nINI: NrCaptureBackoff（0 指数退避，1 固定 100 微秒，2 事件）。"},
{"Default off. Reuses finished per-frame inline objects with identical inputs instead of\ncreating them every frame, so NR can start sooner. Also applies with GPU-armed handoff.\nApplies to the next frame. INI: NrInlineReuse.", "默认关闭。对输入相同的逐帧 inline 对象复用已完成的结果，而不是每帧新建，\n从而让 NR 更早启动。GPU 触发交接时同样适用。\n下一帧生效。INI: NrInlineReuse。"},
{"Maximum frames in flight. Applies without restarting. Busy slots bypass NR.\nEach frame keeps private inputs and results; the model is shared.\nLowering the limit lets existing work finish before buffers are released.", "最大在途帧数。无需重启即生效。忙碌的槽位会跳过 NR。\n每帧保留独立的输入与结果；模型共享。\n降低上限会让已有工作完成后再释放缓冲。"},
{"Save and restart to change startup hook preparation. Off loads only the active backend.", "更改启动钩子准备方式需要保存并重启。关闭时只加载当前后端。"},
{"On (default): run at the NR input size, padded for the network.\nNR -> SR uses render resolution; SR -> NR uses the upscaled output resolution.\nHigher resolutions cost more GPU time and VRAM; 4K can be several times slower than 1080p.\nOverrides tier and Compact 1080 settings within the supported processing budget.\nOutside that budget, use the tier settings below. Changes rebuild the network next frame.", "开启（默认）：按 NR 输入尺寸运行，并为网络做填充。\nNR -> SR 使用渲染分辨率；SR -> NR 使用超分后的输出分辨率。\n更高分辨率会消耗更多 GPU 时间与显存；4K 可能比 1080p 慢数倍。\n在支持的处理预算内会覆盖层级与 Compact 1080 设置。\n超出预算时请使用下方的层级设置。更改会在下一帧重建网络。"},
{"On (default): lmxxf picks the smallest tier that fits.\nOff: pin NR to one tier in the menu below.\nApplies on the next network rebuild. Written to OptiScaler.ini with Save Settings.", "开启（默认）：lmxxf 自动选择能容纳的最小层级。\n关闭：在下方菜单中把 NR 固定到某一层级。\n下次网络重建时生效。保存设置会写入 OptiScaler.ini。"},
{"Off (default): 1152 processing rows. On: 1088 rows.\nMay reduce NR time but changes the image, especially near the bottom edge.\nOnly affects the 1080 tier; rebuilds on the next frame.", "关闭（默认）：1152 处理行。开启：1088 行。\n可能缩短 NR 耗时，但会改变画面，尤其是底边附近。\n仅影响 1080 层级；下一帧重建。"},
{"When the game does not send a usable exposure texture,\nmeasure the frame's mean brightness once per frame and\nsmooth it over time so highlights do not jump.\nIgnores Exposure scale.\nGames that already pass exposure are unchanged.\nApplies on the next frame. No restart.", "当游戏未提供可用的曝光纹理时，\n每帧测量一次画面平均亮度并随时间平滑，避免高光跳变。\n忽略 Exposure scale。\n已经提供曝光的游戏不受影响。\n下一帧生效，无需重启。"},
{"Manual paper white when Auto exposure is off\n(including when the game sends pre-exposure).\nHigher darkens the network input and weakens\nhighlight rolloff. Default 8.", "自动曝光关闭时的手动纸白值\n（包括游戏发送预曝光的情形）。\n数值越高，网络输入越暗、高光滚降越弱。默认 8。"},
{"White level used by encode and decode. Default 1.\nLog slider, so 1 is easy to land on. Reset returns to 1.\nNot the HDR Paper White control further down.\nApplies on the next frame. No restart.", "编码与解码使用的白电平。默认 1。\n对数滑块，便于落在 1。重置会回到 1。\n它不是下方的 HDR 纸白控制。\n下一帧生效，无需重启。"},
{"Exposure used by the neural model. Auto estimates brightness from the image.\nGame uses the game's exposure texture when available; otherwise it falls back to Auto.\nSeparate from the appearance filter's Exposure (EV).", "神经网络模型使用的曝光。自动模式从画面估计亮度。\n游戏模式在游戏提供曝光纹理时使用它，否则回退到自动。\n与外观滤镜的曝光（EV）相互独立。"},
{"Display curve the network sees (ToneCurve).\nReinhard usually has better colour; ACES if highlights oversaturate.", "网络看到的显示曲线（ToneCurve）。\nReinhard 通常颜色更好；高光过饱和时用 ACES。"},
{"Floor of the display curve (ToneLift / Black lift). 0 = none.", "显示曲线的下限（ToneLift / 黑位提升）。0 = 无。"},
{"Select 1-3 passes at the chosen NR/SR stage. With Predict third pass on, 3 uses two real passes plus a local prediction.\nPasses 2/3 add frame-sized buffers. Adaptive ViT reuse is disabled with multiple passes.\nChanging this rebuilds the network next frame; GPU timing includes all passes.", "在所选 NR/SR 阶段选择 1-3 层。开启“预测第三层”时，3 表示两层真实 + 一次局部预测。\n第 2/3 层会增加帧尺寸缓冲。多层时自适应 ViT 复用会被禁用。\n更改会在下一帧重建网络；GPU 计时包含所有层。"},
{"Default on in 0.41. Only active with 3 passes: run two real passes and predict the third locally.\nApproximate result; turn off for three real network passes. Passes 1/2 are unchanged by this option.\nINI: DLSS5_MULTI_PASS_PREDICT. Changes rebuild the network next frame.", "0.41 起默认开启。仅在 3 层时生效：跑两层真实，第三层本地预测。\n结果为近似值；需要三层真实推理时请关闭。第 1/2 层不受此选项影响。\nINI: DLSS5_MULTI_PASS_PREDICT。更改会在下一帧重建网络。"},
{"Default off. At 2/3 passes, blend skin-coloured regions toward pass 1.\nColour heuristic: may select warm scenery or miss skin under coloured lighting. Ignored with one pass.\nINI: DLSS5_MULTI_PASS_SKIN_PROTECT. Changes rebuild the network next frame.", "默认关闭。2/3 层时把肤色区域向第 1 层混合。\n颜色启发式：可能误选暖色场景，或在彩色光照下漏掉皮肤。单层时忽略。\nINI: DLSS5_MULTI_PASS_SKIN_PROTECT。更改会在下一帧重建网络。"},
{"On by default. 0.41 extends approximate math from C32/C64/C128 to ViT and C512 projection.\nOutput can differ from 0.40 even with 1/2 passes.\nOff selects the normal numeric modules. Changing this rebuilds the network next frame.", "默认开启。0.41 把近似数学从 C32/C64/C128 扩展到 ViT 与 C512 投影。\n即使 1/2 层，输出也可能与 0.40 不同。\n关闭则使用常规数值模块。更改会在下一帧重建网络。"},
{"Network style 0 / 1 / 2. Default: 1.\nChanging style rebuilds the network on the next frame.", "网络风格 0 / 1 / 2。默认：1。\n更改风格会在下一帧重建网络。"},
{"Quality (0.4.2+). Reference keeps NVIDIA's exact arithmetic (default).\nFast is usually visually equivalent and faster.\nRX 7000 always runs Reference.", "质量（0.4.2+）。Reference 保持 NVIDIA 的精确算术（默认）。\nFast 通常视觉等价且更快。\nRX 7000 始终使用 Reference。"},
{"Model appearance profile. Applies to all active passes.", "模型外观预设。作用于所有活动层。"},
{"Model lighting and colour response. Applied on the first pass.\nSeparate from Tone strength in the appearance filter.", "模型光照与颜色响应。在第 1 层应用。\n与外观滤镜中的色调强度独立。"},
{"Enable the broad structure response in addition to the character channels.", "在角色通道之外，额外启用大结构响应。"},
{"Enable the model's semantic character channels.\nSeparate from Automatic skin mask in the appearance filter.", "启用模型的语义角色通道。\n与外观滤镜中的自动皮肤掩码独立。"},
{"Upstream production kernels. Both (3) is the official 0.35+ template default.\nOff restores the previous f32 ViT path.\nViT stream and ViT byte stream are mutually exclusive.\nEnabling ViT byte stream turns off adaptive reuse.\nApplies on the next network rebuild.", "上游生产内核。Both (3) 是官方 0.35+ 模板默认值。\n关闭会恢复之前的 f32 ViT 路径。\nViT stream 与 ViT byte stream 互斥。\n启用 ViT byte stream 会关闭自适应复用。\n下次网络重建时生效。"},
{"Static frames reuse ViT; motion returns to full cost.\nTemporarily incompatible with Temporal history due to flicker.\nEnabling adaptive reuse turns off ViT byte stream.\nStrength sliders are tunable (not bit-exact).\nApplies on the next network rebuild.", "静态帧复用 ViT；有运动时恢复完整开销。\n因闪烁问题，暂时与时域历史不兼容。\n启用自适应复用会关闭 ViT byte stream。\n强度滑块可调（非逐位精确）。\n下次网络重建时生效。"},
{"How much of the network's detail replaces the upscaler picture.\n0 is the upscaler picture. 1 is the network result.\nAbove 1 pushes past that result, up to 3.\nApplies on the next frame. No restart.", "网络细节替换超分画面的程度。\n0 = 超分画面，1 = 网络结果。\n大于 1 会推过该结果，最高到 3。\n下一帧生效，无需重启。"},
{"How much of the network's colour replaces the game's hue.\n0: game image as-is (except brightness from Transfer).\n1: network brightness, game colour (safest for saturated scenes).\nAbove 1 blends toward the full network colour (toy; can tint).\nApplies on the next frame. No restart.", "网络颜色替换游戏色相的程度。\n0：保持游戏画面（仅亮度来自 Transfer）。\n1：网络亮度 + 游戏颜色（高饱和场景最安全）。\n大于 1 会向完整网络颜色混合（实验性，可能偏色）。\n下一帧生效，无需重启。"},
{"On (default): prepare hot switching when lmxxf is installed. Restart after changing.\nOff: start with only the selected backend; changing backends needs a game restart.\nAlso OptiScaler.ini [DlssNr] NrConvenience=0/1.", "开启（默认）：安装 lmxxf 时准备热切换。更改后需重启。\n关闭：仅以选定后端启动；切换后端需要重启游戏。\n另见 OptiScaler.ini [DlssNr] NrConvenience=0/1。"},
{"Allow supported additional game colour formats through a private FP16 output.\nRestart the game after changing this setting.", "通过私有 FP16 输出支持更多游戏颜色格式。\n更改后请重启游戏。"},
{"Overlaps HIP kernel launches. Leave this on.\nThe picture is the same either way.\nTurn it off only when neural rendering fails to start\nand the log says: missing HIP export hipExtModuleLaunchKernel.\nThe running chain does not pick this up.", "重叠 HIP 内核启动。请保持开启。\n两种情况下画面相同。\n仅当神经渲染无法启动、\n且日志提示 missing HIP export hipExtModuleLaunchKernel 时才关闭。\n运行中的链路不会拾取此更改。"},
{"Off: Temporal history on, skip a frame if the previous network is\nstill busy. Closer to 60 FPS; more ghosting because FSR also accumulates.\n\nOn: after Execute, wait for the HIP job only (Temporal off). Does not wait\nfor the D3D12 fence / FSR batch. Closer to danielblnc 0.3's 40+ at a 4K FSR\nUltra Performance render; the next Record may still skip if GPU work is\nin flight.", "关闭：开启时域历史，若上一个网络仍忙则跳帧。更接近 60 FPS；因 FSR 也会累积，拖影更多。\n\n开启：Execute 之后仅等待 HIP 作业（关闭时域）。不等待\nD3D12 fence / FSR 批次。更接近 danielblnc 0.3 在 4K FSR\n超高性能渲染下的 40+；若 GPU 工作尚未完成，下次 Record 仍可能跳过。"},
{"Select the model to run. Changes rebuild the network in the background.\nEach entry is enabled only when its model file is present under dlssnr-amd.\nINT4 mixed is available only with 310.8.0 and active ACO; its saved preference is retained.\nINI: [DlssNr] MochizukiNetworkModel=0 (original) / 1 (new). Save Settings to keep the selection.", "选择要运行的模型。更改后会在后台重建网络。\n每项仅在其模型文件存在于 dlssnr-amd 下时才启用。\nINT4 混合模式仅在 310.8.0 且 ACO 活跃时可用；其保存的偏好会保留。\nINI: [DlssNr] MochizukiNetworkModel=0（原始）/ 1（新版）。保存设置以保留选择。"},
{"310.8.0 (original)", "310.8.0（原始模型）"},
{"310.9.16 (new)", "310.9.16（新模型）"},
{"Select the model to run. Changes rebuild the network in the background.\n310.9.16 requires dlssnr-small.bin; without it the original model runs.\nINT4 mixed is available only with 310.8.0 and active ACO; its saved preference is retained.\nINI: [DlssNr] MochizukiNetworkModel=0 (original) / 1 (new). Save Settings to keep the selection.", "选择运行的模型。更改后在后台重建网络。\n310.9.16 需要 dlssnr-small.bin；缺失时运行原始模型。\nINT4 混合模式需要 310.8.0 和已生效的 ACO；其设置会保留。\nINI：[DlssNr] MochizukiNetworkModel=0（原始）/ 1（新）。保存设置以保留选择。"},
{"Active model: %s", "当前模型：%s"},
{"Requested model is pending or unavailable. Install dlssnr-small.bin from your 310.9.16 DLL to use the new model.", "所选模型正在准备或不可用。请从自备的 310.9.16 DLL 提取并安装 dlssnr-small.bin 以使用新模型。"},
{"INT4 mixed inactive; select 310.8.0, enable ACO and prepare matching INT4 weights.", "INT4 混合模式未生效；请选择 310.8.0、启用 ACO 并准备匹配的 INT4 权重。"},
{"Ctrl+F11 switches the INT4 request. INT4 requires the 310.8.0 model and active ACO; model and ACO preferences are retained. Save Settings to keep the selection.", "Ctrl+F11 切换 INT4 请求。INT4 需要 310.8.0 模型和已生效的 ACO；模型和 ACO 设置会保留。保存设置以保留选择。"},
{"Edge-aware", "边缘引导"},
{"Classic scaler", "经典缩放"},
{"Bilinear", "两次线性"},
{"ACO fast mode (experimental)", "ACO 快速模式（实验）"},
{"ACO mode", "ACO 模式"},
{"Reuse output buffer", "复用输出缓冲"},
{"Model enlargement applies below 100% model scale. Matched residual is the default. Edge-aware costs more GPU time. Classic uses the scaler below (ClassicScaler); Catmull-Rom is its default.\nReuse output buffer keeps one full-resolution float image when the frame is RGBA32F. Switching rebuilds the network.", "模型分辨率低于 100% 时生效。默认使用匹配残差。边缘引导更耗时。经典模式使用下方缩放（ClassicScaler），默认 Catmull-Rom。\nRGBA32F 画面复用一张全分辨率浮点图像。切换会重建网络。"},
{"ACO requested, effective %u. %s", "已请求 ACO，实际生效 %u。%s"},
{"Uses the shipped ACO machine code instead of the driver's compiler.\nExperimental. Another driver may reject it; NR then keeps the driver's compiler.\nSave Settings, then restart the game. This session does not switch.\nINI: [DlssNr] MochizukiAcoMode.", "使用随包的 ACO 机器码，而不是驱动的编译器。\n实验功能。其他驱动可能拒绝；此时 NR 继续使用驱动编译器。\n请保存设置，然后重启游戏。本次会话不会切换。\nINI：[DlssNr] MochizukiAcoMode。"},
{"Rendering", "渲染"},
{"Upscaling", "超分辨率"},
{"Latency & FPS", "延迟与帧率"},
