{"Person protection", "人物保护"},
{"Person NR strength", "人物强度"},
{"Person detail", "人物细节"},
{"Person protection active", "人物保护已生效"},
{"Available with lmxxf and Mochizuki.", "支持 lmxxf 和 Mochizuki。"},
{"Single pass: lower person strength or detail to apply protection.", "单层时，降低人物强度或人物细节才会改变画面。"},
{"Experimental: single pass uses final NR; multi-pass keeps pass 1 for people. Scene uses final NR. Requires the person model and ONNX Runtime.\nThis does not change backend character/skin controls or reduce network passes. Missing or invalid masks preserve final NR.", "实验功能：单层使用当前 NR 结果，多层时人物保留第一层，场景使用最终层。需要人物模型和 ONNX Runtime。\n不会修改后端的角色/肤色参数，也不会减少网络计算。蒙版缺失或失效时保留正常 NR。"},
{"1 keeps the selected NR pass. 0 keeps the NR input inside a reliable person mask, before shared output effects.\nBackend character controls and Overall Intensity still apply; combining protections can weaken the result.", "1 保留选定层的 NR 效果；0 在可靠的人物区域保留 NR 输入画面，之后仍会经过公共输出调节。\n后端角色控制和整体强度仍然有效，叠加多项保护可能让人物效果过弱。"},
{"Reduces fine NR changes on people while retaining broad lighting changes and original detail. 1 = unchanged.\nThis uses the full person mask, not precise face or skin detection. Shared residual gains still apply afterwards.", "减少 NR 在人物上新增的细碎纹理，保留大范围明暗变化和原图细节。1 不作调整。\n作用于完整人物蒙版，不是精确的人脸或皮肤检测；之后仍会经过公共残差增益调节。"},
{"Show person mask overlay", "显示人物蒙版诊断"},
{"Displays a green overlay on detected person areas for alignment and stability diagnostics.", "在识别到的人物区域显示绿色半透明蒙版，用于诊断检测范围、边缘对齐度与时序稳定性。"},
{"Person model", "人物识别模型"},
{"PP-HumanSeg (Fast ~8ms)", "PP-HumanSeg（快速 ~8ms）"},
{"YOLO11n-seg (Baseline ~64ms)", "YOLO11n-seg（基准 ~64ms）"},
{"YuNet (Face only)", "YuNet（仅面部）"},
{"Only the selected model runs. PP-HumanSeg and YOLO cover the body; YuNet protects detected faces with a soft oval.\nYuNet offers 320, 384, 416 and 448 inputs. Small, turned or occluded faces may be missed; hair and clothing are not protected.\nModel times vary by CPU. This does not repair flicker in the backend's own output.", "只运行选中的模型。PP-HumanSeg 和 YOLO 识别全身；YuNet 仅柔和保护检测到的脸部区域。\nYuNet 可选 320、384、416 和 448 输入尺寸。小脸、侧脸或被遮挡的脸可能漏检；不保护非面部区域。\n耗时取决于 CPU。本选项不修复后端输出本身的闪烁。"},
{"person model ready (PP-HumanSeg)", "人物模型已就绪 (PP-HumanSeg)"},
{"person model ready (YOLO11n-seg)", "人物模型已就绪 (YOLO11n-seg)"},
{"person model ready (YuNet (Face only))", "人物模型已就绪（YuNet，仅面部）"},

{"Face input size", "人脸输入尺寸"},
{"Experimental inline execution", "实验性内联执行"},
{"Keeps the game command list intact. Bounded wait selects the original frame on timeout.\nShared by lmxxf and Mochizuki. INI: NrInline. Off uses command-list splitting.", "保持游戏命令列表完整。有限等待超时后使用原帧。\nlmxxf 和 Mochizuki 共用。INI：NrInline。关闭时使用命令列表切分。"},
{"Experimental. Inline execution restores known whole-resource layouts; partial or pending layouts are rejected.", "实验选项。内联执行会恢复已知的完整资源布局；局部或未完成的布局转换会被拒绝。"},
{"Full-frame YuNet input. Larger sizes can detect smaller faces but use more CPU time. Default 320. Changing size resets the face mask.", "YuNet 全画面检测的输入尺寸。较大尺寸有助于识别小脸，但 CPU 耗时更高。默认 320，切换后重置脸部蒙版。"},
{"Free. Don't buy.", "免费使用，谨防上当"},

