{"The most the model may darken a highlight, in stops: lower holds highlights more (0.25 is strong), 2 changes nothing and 0 is off. HDR games on the Display codec only (Codec Auto picks it for most), and only where the model darkens bright areas, as the Natural and Cinematic styles do. This is not Max ratio, the native route's ratio limit.", "模型可将高光压暗的最大档数：越低越能保留高光（0.25 的保护较强），2 不改变结果，0 表示关闭。仅适用于使用 Display 编码的 HDR 游戏（Auto 通常会自动选择），且仅在模型压暗亮部时生效，例如自然与电影风格。它不是原生路径的 Max ratio 比例上限。"},
