{"GPU-armed handoff", "GPU 捕获交接"},
{"Default on. Mochizuki inline: the GPU side queue runs a bounded capture watch.\nNR starts without CPU capture verification. A miss shows the original frame and resets history later.\nKnown input/history risk on timeout or abort. Applies to the next frame. INI: NrGpuHandoff.", "默认开启。Mochizuki inline：GPU 侧队列有界等待本帧输入捕获。\n不经 CPU 确认捕获即启动 NR；未完成时显示原画面，回收时重置历史。\n超时或中止时存在已知的输入与历史同步问题。\n下一帧生效。INI: NrGpuHandoff。"},
{"Person protection is unavailable with RenoDX. Your settings are preserved for the original mode.", "RenoDX 模式不支持人物保护。原模式的设置会保留，切回后恢复使用。"},
{"Ctrl+F11 switches the default network and INT4 mixed. ACO preference is unchanged; INT4 requires active ACO. Save Settings to keep the selection.", "Ctrl+F11 切换默认网络和 INT4 混合网络，不改变 ACO 设置。INT4 需要 ACO 实际生效。保存设置可保留选择。"},
{"Inline spin experiments", "内联自旋实验选项"},
{"Inline auto-tuning", "内联自动调优"},
{"Default on. Jointly selects Spin poll delay and Game wait dispatches from the validated 9-candidate whitelist.\nAxes set to Auto are searched; explicitly fixed axes stay pinned. INI: NrInlineAutoSpin.", "默认开启。从已验证的 9 项候选白名单中联合选择自旋轮询延迟和游戏等待调用次数。\n设为自动的项会参与测试，显式固定的项保持锁定。INI：NrInlineAutoSpin。"},
{"Auto-spin status: %s | Effective: poll %d, wait %d", "自动调优状态：%s | 当前生效：轮询 %d，等待 %d"},
{"Inactive", "未启用"},
{"Suspended", "已暂停"},
{"Stabilizing", "稳定采样中"},
{"Exploring", "候选测试中"},
{"Confirming", "复核确认中"},
{"Locked", "已锁定"},
{"Adaptive wait budget is enabled", "已启用自适应等待预算"},
{"Inline auto-tuning is off", "内联自动调优已关闭"},
{"Manual fixed values on both axes", "两个参数项均已手动固定"},
{"Spin poll delay", "自旋轮询延迟"},
{"16 (default)", "16（默认）"},
{"ALU work between GPU flag polls (game wait and side watch). Auto lets inline auto-tuning choose; when auto-tuning is off, Auto uses 16.\nApplies to the next frame. INI: NrSpinPollDelay.", "GPU 标志位轮询之间的 ALU 计算量（游戏等待与旁路等待）。自动由内联自动调优选择；关闭自动调优时自动使用 16。\n下一帧生效。INI：NrSpinPollDelay。"},
{"Game wait dispatches", "游戏等待调用次数"},
{"64 (default)", "64（默认）"},
{"Experimental. Splits the game-queue inline wait into shorter GPU dispatches (same timeout). Auto lets inline auto-tuning choose; when auto-tuning is off, Auto uses 64.\nApplies to the next frame. INI: NrSpinSlices.", "实验功能。将游戏队列的内联等待拆分为更短的 GPU 调用（总超时相同）。自动由内联自动调优选择；关闭自动调优时自动使用 64。\n下一帧生效。INI：NrSpinSlices。"},
{"Both Auto", "全部恢复自动"},
{"Re-evaluate", "重新测试"},
{"Side watch dispatches", "旁路等待调用次数"},
{"Experimental. Splits the side-queue capture watch into shorter dispatches.\nApplies to the next frame. INI: NrWatchSlices.", "实验功能。将旁路队列的捕获等待拆分为更短的调用。\n下一帧生效。INI：NrWatchSlices。"},
{"Side watch start delay", "旁路等待启动延迟"},
{"Off (default)", "关闭（默认）"},
{"Experimental. ALU-only dispatches (followed by a barrier) before the watch starts polling.\nCan delay NR start if the capture comes early. Applies to the next frame. INI: NrWatchStartDelay.", "实验功能。旁路等待开始轮询前先执行的纯 ALU 调用（后接屏障）。\n若捕获较早完成可能推迟 NR 启动。下一帧生效。INI：NrWatchStartDelay。"},
{"Spin options need GPU-armed handoff.", "自旋选项需要启用 GPU 捕获交接。"},
{"Temporal mode", "时序模式"},
{"Full model history (Mode 1)", "完整模型历史（模式 1）"},
{"Low-frequency (Mode 2)", "低频稳定（模式 2）"},
{"Residual enhance (Mode 3)", "残差增强（模式 3）"},
{"Selects the lmxxf temporal history path:\n- Off (0): Single-frame inference without temporal history.\n- Full model history (1, default): Reprojects previous model output with depth/motion warp and model temporal blend (1-3 passes before SR).\n- Low-frequency (2): Motion-guided low-frequency temporal stabilization on single-pass output before SR.\n- Residual enhance (3): Motion-guided single-pass residual temporal enhancement before SR.\nActive temporal modes temporarily disable ViT adaptive reuse to avoid flicker; your reuse settings are retained.\nUnsupported combinations keep your settings and run without history.", "选择 lmxxf 时序历史模式：\n- 关闭（0）：单帧推理，不使用时序历史。\n- 完整模型历史（1，默认）：在超分前重投影上一帧模型输出并混合时序历史（支持 1–3 层）。\n- 低频稳定（2）：在超分前对单层输出执行基于运动引导的低频时序稳定。\n- 残差增强（3）：在超分前对单层输出执行基于运动引导的残差时序增强。\n启用任意时序模式期间会暂时禁用 ViT 自适应复用以避免闪烁，原有复用设置会保留。\n不支持的组合会保留设置并退回无历史运行。"},
{"Enhance strength", "增强强度"},
{"Residual temporal enhancement gain for Mode 3 (0.00..2.00, default 1.00).", "模式 3 的残差时序增强增益（0.00..2.00，默认 1.00）。"},
{"Dynamic MFG", "动态多帧生成"},
{"DMFG Rounding", "动态多帧取整"},
{"Down", "向下"},
{"Nearest", "最近"},
{"Up", "向上"},
{"Allow 1X", "允许 1X"},
{"Picks the multiplier every frame, up to the Frame Gen setting,\nthe lowest that reaches the target. At a 2X Frame Gen it turns\nframe generation off and on instead of changing the multiplier.\nIt can go above the target, only the FPS limit or V-Sync caps\nthe presented frame rate. When the target can't be reached, a\nhigher multiplier is kept only if it raises the frame rate\nenough: each generated frame costs GPU time.", "每帧在设定倍率上限内自动选择能到目标帧率的最低倍率。\n帧生成设为 2X 时改为在开/关帧生成之间切换，而非改变倍率。\n呈现帧率可能高于目标，仅受帧率上限或垂直同步限制。\n每个生成帧均消耗 GPU 时间，无法到目标时仅在提升明显时保留高倍率。"},
{"0 means OptiScaler's FPS limit, or without one just under the display\nrefresh rate (116 at 120 Hz). A target above the FPS limit uses the limit.", "0 表示使用 OptiScaler 帧率上限，未设上限时略低于显示器刷新率（120Hz 下为 116）。\n高于帧率上限的目标将使用该上限。"},
{"How the multiplier the target asks for (target / real frame rate) is rounded.\nIt changes only when clearly off, so the frame rate can sit under the target.\nDown: stays under the target (2X from 61% of it).\nNearest: around the target (2X from 71%, 6X from 88%).\nUp: reaches the target (2X from 87%, 6X from 95%).", "目标所需倍率（目标帧率 / 真实帧率）的取整方式。\n仅在偏差明显时切换，实际帧率可能略低于目标。\n向下：保持低于目标（2X 约 61% 起）。\n最近：围绕目标（2X 约 71%，6X 约 88% 起）。\n向上：优先到目标（2X 约 87%，6X 约 95% 起）。"},
{"Lets Dynamic MFG turn frame generation off (1X) when the game alone\nis close enough to the target (to nearest: from 56% of it).\nTurning it back on shows one real frame without generated frames.", "当游戏原生帧率已接近目标（最近取整下约 56% 起）时，允许动态关闭帧生成（1X）。\n重新开启的首帧仅显示真实帧。"},

{"Original (71 blocks)", "Original（71 块）"},
{"Small (310.9.16, 31 blocks)", "Small（310.9.16，31 块）"},
{"Small runs once. Pass settings below are retained for Original.", "Small 运行一次，下方层数设置为 Original 保留。"},
{"Small uses a different trained model and one network pass. Original retains your 1-3 pass preference.\nRequires matching small weights in native-game-tiled-assets/small. Missing assets or incompatible options use Original with a status message.\nINI: LmxxfNetworkModel (0 Original, 1 Small). Changing models rebuilds the network next frame.", "Small 使用独立训练的模型，运行一次。Original 保留原来的 1–3 层设置。\n需要 native-game-tiled-assets/small 中的对应权重。权重缺失或选项不兼容时使用 Original，并显示原因。\nINI：LmxxfNetworkModel（0 为 Original，1 为 Small）。切换在下一帧生效，首次可能稍有停顿。"},
{"Small assets are missing or damaged. Using Original; rerun model setup and restart the game.", "Small 权重缺失或损坏，当前使用 Original。请重新准备模型并重启游戏。"},
{"Temporal modes 2/3 currently require Original. Select Off or Native history to use Small.", "时序模式 2/3 目前需要 Original。关闭时序或选择原生历史即可使用 Small。"},
{"Current advanced kernel settings require Original. Restore compatible model defaults to use Small.", "当前高级内核设置需要 Original。恢复兼容的模型默认值后可使用 Small。"},
{"Network passes", "网络层数"},
{"NR flicker diagnostics", "NR 闪烁诊断"},
{"Default off. Enables coverage details, per-frame trace, game-thread timing and file logging.\nSave Settings and restart, reproduce for 30-60 seconds after the model is ready, then exit normally.\nSend OptiScaler*.log, mochizuki_nr.log*, NrFrameDiag.log* and OptiScaler.ini.\nLeaves processing and compatibility settings unchanged. INI: NrFlickerDiag.", "默认关闭。统一开启处理覆盖详细日志、逐帧追踪、游戏线程计时及文件日志。\n保存设置并重启，等待模型就绪后复现 30–60 秒，再正常退出游戏。\n发送 OptiScaler*.log、mochizuki_nr.log*、NrFrameDiag.log* 和 OptiScaler.ini。\n不改变处理与兼容性设置。INI：NrFlickerDiag。"},
{"FSR4 Model", "FSR4 模型"},
{"FSR 4 network to run. Auto lets FFX pick the best model supported by the GPU.", "选择 FSR 4 网络。自动模式由 FFX 选择显卡支持的最佳模型。"},
{"SR Dynamic Resolution (DRS)", "超分动态分辨率（DRS）"},
{"Follow the game's changing render size in FSR. This is not Mochizuki's NR resolution policy.", "让 FSR 跟随游戏动态变化的渲染尺寸。这不是 Mochizuki 的 NR 分辨率策略。"},
{"Loaded ASI Plugins", "已加载的 ASI 插件"},
{"Quirks / ASI", "游戏兼容规则 / ASI"},
{"Frame Gen", "帧生成"},
{"Max Frame Gen", "帧生成倍率上限"},

// Low latency inputs / Dynamic MFG target-as-cap (D8/B2).
{"Override XeFG Ratio", "覆盖 XeFG 倍率"},
{"The game's own XeFG runs on OptiScaler's XeFG libraries (XeFG input with XeFG output).\nDefault leaves the game's count, Off disables its frame generation,\na ratio replaces the game's count within what its context was created with.", "游戏自带的 XeFG 在 OptiScaler 的 XeFG 库上运行（XeFG 输入配 XeFG 输出）。\n默认沿用游戏的倍数；关闭则停用其帧生成；\n指定倍率会在其上下文创建上限内覆盖游戏设置。"},
{"XeFG input: the game's own XeFG (passthrough)", "XeFG 输入：游戏自带 XeFG（直通）"},
{"XeFG input: feeding the selected Frame Generation output", "XeFG 输入：正在送入所选帧生成输出"},
{"At most target", "至多接近目标"},
{"Around target", "围绕目标"},
{"At least target", "至少达到目标"},
{"Where FPS may land, as multipliers only come in steps: at most, around\nor at least the target FPS. It changes only when clearly off, so the\nframe rate can sit under the target.\nAt most target: 2X from 61% of it.\nAround target: 2X from 71%, 6X from 88%.\nAt least target: 2X from 87%, 6X from 95%.", "倍率只能整档变化，帧率相应落在目标附近：至多、围绕\n或至少达到目标帧率。仅在偏差明显时切换，实际帧率可能略低于目标。\n至多接近目标：2X 约从目标的 61% 起。\n围绕目标：2X 约 71%，6X 约 88% 起。\n至少达到目标：2X 约 87%，6X 约 95% 起。"},
{"Use Target as FPS Cap", "目标同时作为帧率上限"},
{"Also limits FPS to the target and uses the lowest multiplier that reaches it.\nNo rounding band and no 1X: any sustained shortfall steps up, and a step\ndown is undone if the target can't be held. Needs a Frame Gen setting above 2X.", "同时把帧率限制到目标，并使用能达到目标的最低倍率。\n无取整区间、无 1X：持续不达标立即升档；降档后若无法维持目标则回退。\n需要帧生成设置高于 2X。"},
